				"Maintain a shared base with food, labelled storage, safe transport, guest beds and room for future projects."
				"Graduation measures independence and contribution rather than total completion. Choose evidence from the way you actually played: a safe route, useful room, working system, researched collection, or lesson taught to someone else."
				"Record a legacy project with a sign, book, photograph, or map marker. Include who built it, what it does, where inputs belong, and what must never be changed while it is running."
